'''Horror Movies''' (ホラー映画, ''Horā Eiga'', '''Horror Movie''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (M): The effect of this ability is increased by 20%.

